    "detailed_description": "Leafblade is a cozy monster tamer mixed with action RPG and farming sim.<br><br>You are Rain, a human chosen to carry the Leaf that can create bonds with wild Mons and prevent their extinction. Fight against wild Mons to uncover the mystery behind their aggressiveness, bond with them, take them on adventures and foster them in your Farm Sanctuary with their farm skills to gather food and cook delicious meals to improve their abilities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/439c3dfc182b836561f4f86bc43e89b8.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/439c3dfc182b836561f4f86bc43e89b8.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Mons can be deadly as enemies but once a bond has been created with them, they will be the best companions in combat with their passive and active abilities or help you grow crops with their Farm skills. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/d6ba1b0b53a2b8960765ef134f1b1bbe.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/d6ba1b0b53a2b8960765ef134f1b1bbe.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Discover the mystery behind the lost bond between Mons and humans by looking for and talking with the four ancient Mons that rule over monsters.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/4c91349ca0b61dccbfea0df418f207a7.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/4c91349ca0b61dccbfea0df418f207a7.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Some Mons will require just a drop of Dew from your Leafblade, while others will have much complicated requirements like food, objects or even bonds with other Mons.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/60887795d405f2bf540503584f2addbf.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/60887795d405f2bf540503584f2addbf.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Your Farm Sanctuary is the best place to rest between adventures, grow crops with your Mons, decorate, cook food for Mons or humans and improve your Leafblade skills before a big challenge. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/1184a5c161e395d850447ea0586bd7fc.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/1184a5c161e395d850447ea0586bd7fc.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Cook dishes to increase the stats of your Mons, feed them the right dishes to awake new combat abilities and decorate your farm to ensure they are happy in it!",
    "about_the_game": "Leafblade is a cozy monster tamer mixed with action RPG and farming sim.<br><br>You are Rain, a human chosen to carry the Leaf that can create bonds with wild Mons and prevent their extinction. Fight against wild Mons to uncover the mystery behind their aggressiveness, bond with them, take them on adventures and foster them in your Farm Sanctuary with their farm skills to gather food and cook delicious meals to improve their abilities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/439c3dfc182b836561f4f86bc43e89b8.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/439c3dfc182b836561f4f86bc43e89b8.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Mons can be deadly as enemies but once a bond has been created with them, they will be the best companions in combat with their passive and active abilities or help you grow crops with their Farm skills. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/d6ba1b0b53a2b8960765ef134f1b1bbe.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/d6ba1b0b53a2b8960765ef134f1b1bbe.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Discover the mystery behind the lost bond between Mons and humans by looking for and talking with the four ancient Mons that rule over monsters.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/4c91349ca0b61dccbfea0df418f207a7.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/4c91349ca0b61dccbfea0df418f207a7.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Some Mons will require just a drop of Dew from your Leafblade, while others will have much complicated requirements like food, objects or even bonds with other Mons.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/60887795d405f2bf540503584f2addbf.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/60887795d405f2bf540503584f2addbf.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Your Farm Sanctuary is the best place to rest between adventures, grow crops with your Mons, decorate, cook food for Mons or humans and improve your Leafblade skills before a big challenge. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/1184a5c161e395d850447ea0586bd7fc.poster.avif?t=1748626373\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887740/extras/1184a5c161e395d850447ea0586bd7fc.webm?t=1748626373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Cook dishes to increase the stats of your Mons, feed them the right dishes to awake new combat abilities and decorate your farm to ensure they are happy in it!",
    "short_description": "The coziest mix of ARPG and monster tamer. Fight along the Mons you meet in your adventure to recover the bond between humans and Mons. Take care of your Mons in your farm, improving their combat and farm skills while ensuring their happiness.",
